'''The Cage''' is a [[boss]] that can appear:
* {{dlc|nr}} Only in the {{s|Depths}}.
* {{dlc|r}} In the {{s|Depths}} and the {{s|Dank Depths}}.

== Behavior ==
* Leaps off-screen and tries to land in Isaac's path, predicting his movement. Leaves a small puddle of damaging [[Creep#Grey Creep|Grey Creep]] and sends out 4-5 lines of rock waves upon landing.
* Quickly shoots 6 streams of 3-7 projectiles in a spiral pattern, similar to {{e|Mom's Heart}}/{{e|It Lives!}}.
* Curls up in a ball and rolls towards Isaac, bouncing off walls and obstacles around the room.
* Spawns a grey-coloured {{e|Vis}} that shoots a brown-coloured {{i|Brimstone}} laser.
** The different colours are purely cosmetic, and it behaves exactly like a normal Vis.
** Any Vis caught in The Cage's rolling attack will be killed.

== Champion Versions {{unlockable}} ==
: {{bc|5|dlc=a}}: Periodically leaves puddles of [[Creep#Green Creep|Green Creep]] and doesn't spawn any Vis.
: {{bc|20|dlc=a}}: Two Cages, each with 50% HP (400), replace the normal Cage. They never perform their jump attack. {{dlc|r}} Both Cages are ~50% smaller.

